      "text": "revelations to, D&C 36; 51. sins are forgiven, D&C 36:1. is called to preach gospel, D&C 36:1. to receive the Spirit from Sidney Rigdon, D&C 36:2. to be ordained bishop unto Church, D&C 41:9. Edward Partridge’s heart is pure as Nathanael’s, D&C 41:11. to stand in appointed office, D&C 42:10. warned to repent, D&C 50:39 (58:14–15; 64:17). is directed how to organize people, D&C 51:1–18. to appoint portions unto people, D&C 51:3 (57:7). to journey to Missouri, D&C 52:24 (58:24). to direct conference, D&C 58:62. to provide money for elders’ return, D&C 60:10. revelation addressed to Edward Partridge and counselors, D&C 115. is with the Lord, D&C 124:19.",
